    for (var key2 in TAG_ONLY_STAGE_KEYS) {
        if (!Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(TAG_ONLY_STAGE_KEYS, key2)) continue;
        var derived = defaults[key2];
        if (derived && String(derived).toLowerCase() === wanted) return key2;
    }
    return null;
}
```

Hmm wait — should the first loop stay iterating `statuses` or iterate TAG_ONLY_STAGE_KEYS? Iterating the TAG_ONLY map is cleaner. The original iterated `statuses` — equivalent.

